<PageLayout meta={meta}>
<h1 class="title mb-12 text-center">About Vastrel. </h1>

<div>
	<p class="mb-4">
		<h2 class="title mb-6 text-xl">Where does Vastrel come from? </h2>
		<br>
	<p>Vastrel, formerly known as Null Originate, back in 2015 On a Minecraft server called <b>2B2T</b> <br><br>Within our time in 2B2T, we have met many people, made friends, and enmities along the way. Later on, within our time, we decided to go for a much more peaceful approach, but just building and keeping the group small, Over the years we went from 8 members down to 2 members, being Sophie & Kino. Kino Left 2b2t at the end of 2024 With myself following in suit with him To take a break from Minecraft. <br><br>Over a year later I started to get back into the Minecraft environment by joining a server called 6B6T, this marking the start of my new adventure on a new Anarchy server. While my time here has not been too long, I have met many new people along the way and even brought Vastrel into 6B6T. With a fresh name of Vastrel.<br><br></p>
</p>

<div>
<h1 class="title mb-12 text-center">What do we do?</h1>
<p class="mb-4">Within Vastrel, our main objective is to archive and document the history within the servers and games that we play. This is painfully the case of Minecraft anarchy servers such as 2B2T. With this intention, we fully publicly release all of the data and world downloads in an accessible manner so that everyone can use the data that we have collected. <br><br>Vastrel also has our group bases within 6B6T, where we have many different builds and plans for the future of our time within the server. This means that you could join Vastrel if we reach out to you and have an interest in you and your skills. So why not show some of your work within our Discord at <a href="https://discord.vastrel.net" class="hover:underline"><b>Vastrel Discord</b></a> and see if you can join Vastrel? <br><br>Vastrel is also a place for people to come together and share their work and ideas with each other. This being the case with our <a href="/blog/" class="hover:underline"><b>Vastrel Blog,</b></a> where we have many different posts about our time within the servers that we play on, and also about our time within the Vastrel Collective. <br><br>So why not join us and see what we are all about? </p>

